                </table>
                <p>The total amount is 1,883,329 pounds, valued at $51,850.41, produced as follows,
                    viz: Japan, 1,076,773 pounds; British Possessions, 386,236 pounds; China,
                    311,949 pounds; Dutch Possessions, 108,362 pounds,=1,883,320 pounds.</p>
                <p>None of this rice could possibly be mistaken for Hawaiian rice, and none of it
                    has been shipped out of this kingdom.</p>
                <closer><signed>W. F. ALLEN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Collector-General.</hi></signed>
